{"run_id": "2026-11-01T23-24-smoke-execution-01", "unit": "execution", "item_id": "exe-0000", "model_id": "otel-llm-1.7b-it@2a2d417b", "adapter_id": "none", "grader": "rule-based-parser-v1", "test_set_sha256": "e0152332fba3d220e0e23af6068f127ef4c8cf12333d93efa9a3263c40007a63", "prompt_sha256": "2ee3b6240b3a97f36bee75eaa7f08250af63fe33d7a3e0c83e34422861ffe7ca", "output": "The Shannon formula is given by C = B log2(1 + S/N), where C is the channel capacity in bits per second, B is the bandwidth in Hz, and S/N is the signal-to-noise ratio in dB.\n\nFirst, convert the signal-to-noise ratio from dB to a ratio:\nS/N = 10^(-4.2/10) = 10^(-0.42) ≈ 0.38.\n\nThen, substitute the values into the Shannon formula:\nC = 15,000,000 log2(1 + 0.38) ≈ 15,000,000 log2(1.38) ≈ 15,000,000 * 0.45 ≈ 6,750,000 bits per second.\n\nFinal answer: 6.75", "output_sha256": "6d0742d14388664e3e965757bb050328c5b9ad783d1957fd50af0b84d9866409", "output_tokens": 196, "truncated": false, "batch_started_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:56.213+00:00", "batch_finished_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:03.584+00:00", "batch_wall_s": 7.3709, "latency_s": 0.4607, "parsed": 6.75, "gold": 6.97299, "correct": false, "correct_loose": true}
{"run_id": "2026-11-01T23-24-smoke-execution-01", "unit": "execution", "item_id": "exe-0001", "model_id": "otel-llm-1.7b-it@2a2d417b", "adapter_id": "none", "grader": "rule-based-parser-v1", "test_set_sha256": "e0152332fba3d220e0e23af6068f127ef4c8cf12333d93efa9a3263c40007a63", "prompt_sha256": "bcd5de59634951ef1ce250064cb1b9d984c31f4e657c86907e735e744f9366e5", "output": "FSPL(dB) = 20 log10(9.9) + 20 log10(28000) + 32.44 = 20 * 0.995 + 20 * 4.447 + 32.44 = 19.9 + 88.94 + 32.44 = 141.3 dB.", "output_sha256": "459b7cd9dc2cef9a01de599955f2bf74128eb96ea909a5d02d660213a1a3df2e", "output_tokens": 97, "truncated": false, "batch_started_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:56.213+00:00", "batch_finished_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:03.584+00:00", "batch_wall_s": 7.3709, "latency_s": 0.4607, "parsed": null, "gold": 141.296, "correct": false, "correct_loose": false}
{"run_id": "2026-11-01T23-24-smoke-execution-01", "unit": "execution", "item_id": "exe-0002", "model_id": "otel-llm-1.7b-it@2a2d417b", "adapter_id": "none", "grader": "rule-based-parser-v1", "test_set_sha256": "e0152332fba3d220e0e23af6068f127ef4c8cf12333d93efa9a3263c40007a63", "prompt_sha256": "e666fb5f4eab05301e2c1a210a6fec8baa960b653fab53266caf3527fd84dfab", "output": "The received power in dBm is calculated as the sum of the transmitter output power, the antenna gains, and the path loss. Final answer: 21.4 + 1.1 + 5.0 - 117.4 = -96.7 dBm", "output_sha256": "49807686aaf644f2fe60f2bdc469d634f516e028df23a97fdc7457f9036197d4", "output_tokens": 60, "truncated": false, "batch_started_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:56.213+00:00", "batch_finished_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:03.584+00:00", "batch_wall_s": 7.3709, "latency_s": 0.4607, "parsed": 21.4, "gold": -89.9, "correct": false, "correct_loose": false}
{"run_id": "2026-11-01T23-24-smoke-execution-01", "unit": "execution", "item_id": "exe-0003", "model_id": "otel-llm-1.7b-it@2a2d417b", "adapter_id": "none", "grader": "rule-based-parser-v1", "test_set_sha256": "e0152332fba3d220e0e23af6068f127ef4c8cf12333d93efa9a3263c40007a63", "prompt_sha256": "d81656acb7eb9540aeb22baee1c7e473adce370d0b462413a11fc824c8c6254c", "output": "The receiver noise floor is calculated as the sum of the noise figure and the thermal noise density. The noise figure is 4.71 dB, and the thermal noise density is -174 dBm/Hz. Converting the noise figure to dBm/Hz: 4.71 dB = 4.71 dBm/Hz. Adding the noise figure and the thermal noise density: 4.71 dBm/Hz + (-174 dBm/Hz) = -169.29 dBm/Hz. The receiver noise floor is -169.29 dBm.", "output_sha256": "237e0b1dfd7a8959e5ea1b728da160bf0e4fe2703f5f1100d4eaaeafcd365149", "output_tokens": 131, "truncated": false, "batch_started_at": "2026-11-01T23:28:56.213+00:00", "batch_finished_at": "2026-11-01T23:29:03.584+00:00", "batch_wall_s": 7.3709, "latency_s": 0.4607, "parsed": null, "gold": -99.29, "correct": false, "correct_loose": false}
